# Every contract file the importer has ever shipped, as `shasum -a 256` prints it.
# The installers read this: an installed targets.json / scopes.json whose hash is
# here is an unedited shipped copy and is simply updated; any other hash means
# Brett's edits, and the newer shipped copy lands beside it as <name>.new.
# When a contract file changes, add its new hash here (test_v2 checks that).
